{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An indie game made by an individual developer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I actively listen to feedback on Bilibili. If you have any suggestions, please let me know!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019430/extras/3e66b69114f88dc93f1576520b2081a2.poster.avif?t=1758811658\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019430/extras/3e66b69114f88dc93f1576520b2081a2.webm?t=1758811658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019430/extras/3e66b69114f88dc93f1576520b2081a2.mp4?t=1758811658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting Chases!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront enemies with extremely fast moving speeds, avoid their attacks, and try every means to kill them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019430/extras/bb52f894b3c0314be97f3a087ab8af09.poster.avif?t=1758811658\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019430/extras/bb52f894b3c0314be97f3a087ab8af09.webm?t=1758811658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019430/extras/bb52f894b3c0314be97f3a087ab8af09.mp4?t=1758811658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wardrobe System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can decide what you wear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse